# Public marketing site (www.copantry.com) build-time env vars.
# Copy to `.env` (or set in your host's build config) and fill in.

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# OPTIONAL — defaults to CoPantry's own GA4 property in src/lib/analytics.js, so
# the deployed site tracks out of the box. Override it here for a fork/staging
# property, or set it to an empty value to disable Google Analytics entirely.
# When active, GA loads ONLY after the visitor accepts the cookie notice (GDPR
# consent-gated), with IP anonymisation and ad signals disabled.
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
